Clojure reimagining: single-namespace JVM agent, zero third-party deps
(clojure.core + JDK only), EDN sessions, file-based tools, self-reload.
Local-only build: no network calls except to a user-configured
OpenAI-compatible /chat/completions endpoint at runtime.
